1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,670
(In the 21st year of King Xiang,)

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,550
(Jinan City fell.)

4
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,800
(Three hundred thousand civilians
were slaughtered.)

5
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,190
(Father!)

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,760
(Mother!)

7
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:58,070
(The Shaman Clan of Chu State
fell with the army.)

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,240
(I alone remain.)

9
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,430
(Burning bones as candles)

10
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,150
(to see the way home.)

11
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,480
(Flesh and blood as guide)

12
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,070
(to call my soul to its end.)

13
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,870
(The Phoenix descends
upon the mortal world.)

14
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:17,710
(Defying fate for rebirth!)

15
00:01:26,150 --> 00:01:27,710
(I, the shamaness Chu Li,)

16
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,000
(offer my flesh and blood as sacrifice,)

17
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:34,000
(all to reverse time!)

18
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:47,640
Li.

19
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,310
Who are you?

20
00:02:01,150 --> 00:02:01,920
I'm sorry.

21
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:26,420
=Reunion Across Time=

22
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:29,460
=Episode 1=

23
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,800
(49 Days Before the City Falls)
(Wasn't I already dead?)

24
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,280
(Chu Li, Shamaness)
(This place...)

25
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,360
(Chu Li, Shamaness)
(It's so familiar.)

26
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,400
Have I been reborn?

27
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,910
Shamaness Chu Li,

28
00:03:10,710 --> 00:03:11,800
(Yun Hua)
you abused shamanic arts

29
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,240
(Shamaness)
and murdered the innocent.

30
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:14,840
Such evil must be slain.

31
00:03:16,190 --> 00:03:16,910
(This is)

32
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,520
(49 days ago)

33
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,400
(when I was falsely accused
of being a Flower Demon.)

34
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,910
(I made it.)

35
00:03:24,590 --> 00:03:25,520
(Time has reversed,)

36
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:27,400
(and I have a chance
to save everything.)

37
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:32,000
Instead of repenting, you dare laugh?

38
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:33,280
Today,

39
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,710
I'll purge the Shaman Clan of a traitor.

40
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:38,630
(Kill her! Kill her!)

41
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,240
We're both of the Shaman Clan.

42
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,120
What right do you have to punish me?

43
00:03:42,590 --> 00:03:44,360
Now, the Grand Shaman is in seclusion.

44
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,280
I'd like to see

45
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,630
who can save you now.

46
00:03:51,590 --> 00:03:52,280
(Kill her!)

47
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:59,520
(Kill her! Kill her!)

48
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,120
(If I let Yun Hua have her way)

49
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:04,310
(like I did in my previous life,)

50
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:06,560
(I'll be driven out of Jinan City.)

51
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,360
(This time around,
I'll become Grand Shaman.)

52
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:41,510
(Only then can I persuade the King
to move the capital)

53
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,800
(and save everyone.)

54
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,720
The one in the cage

55
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:46,240
was harmed by your shamanic arts.

56
00:04:46,630 --> 00:04:48,040
Yet you still show no remorse.

57
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,950
I'll have to show no mercy then.

58
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,950
Fire can't harm her.

59
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,390
You evil creature!

60
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:08,630
You're selfish and treacherous,

61
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,800
framing others for crimes.

62
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:11,870
Which of us is truly the evil one?

63
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:15,000
Stop!

64
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:22,460
(Song Ziyuan, Diviner of Chu State)

65
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,800
It's him?

66
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,630
(I'm sorry.)

67
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,870
Who are you?

68
00:05:36,750 --> 00:05:37,560
Diviner Song,

69
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:39,040
what's the meaning of this?

70
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:40,560
(So he's Song Ziyuan,)

71
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:42,270
(a favorite of the King.)

72
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,800
(I didn't know him in my previous life.)

73
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,360
(At this point in my previous life,)

74
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,720
(he hadn't shown up either.)

75
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,310
(So why did he appear this time?)

76
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:51,000
Why such a commotion?

77
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,510
Recently in the city,

78
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,240
many young men and women

79
00:05:54,310 --> 00:05:55,800
have been possessed
by plants and mutated.

80
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,800
In the end, they either
suddenly attack people

81
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,720
or die from the mutation.

82
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,240
And since childhood,
Chu Li has excelled at

83
00:06:02,310 --> 00:06:03,920
controlling flowers, birds, insects,
and beasts.

84
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,360
She's the prime suspect.

85
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,160
As you said, I'm a mere suspect.

86
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:08,720
What right have you to convict me?

87
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:10,510
Punishing a member of the Shaman Clan

88
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,870
is the Grand Shaman's affair.

89
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,750
When did you gain such authority?

90
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:14,870
I...

91
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:18,240
I oversee all affairs
of the Shaman Clan.

92
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:19,070
Now,

93
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,600
take her into custody.

94
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:22,680
After the Grand Shaman leaves seclusion,

95
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,950
we will deal with her.

96
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,510
Wait.

97
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,560
(He actually means to lock me up?)

98
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,480
(Then I won't be able to do anything.)

99
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,510
Chu Li,

100
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,270
you dared to control a demon

101
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,310
to attack Diviner Song?

102
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:52,600
Did you see me do it?

103
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:54,240
I just saved him.

104
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:56,480
Who knows?
Maybe you staged the whole thing.

105
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,480
Guards.

106
00:06:59,190 --> 00:06:59,800
My lord.

107
00:07:00,070 --> 00:07:01,070
Take this demon

108
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,950
and Shamaness Chu Li

109
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:05,160
into custody.

110
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,190
Yes.

111
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,070
(Is he good or evil?)

112
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,390
(Why did he kill me
in my previous life?)

113
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,390
Even if you escape this time,

114
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,160
you won't escape death in the end.

115
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:32,180
(Flower Demon)

116
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,560
Don't move.

117
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,870
If it bites you,

118
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,070
you're dead.

119
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:40,870
You actually escaped.

120
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,870
Miss Chu Li, what's the meaning of this?

121
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,240
Can't you tell?

122
00:07:50,870 --> 00:07:51,950
I'm here to kill you.

123
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:58,950
If you kill me,

124
00:07:59,390 --> 00:08:01,480
then you'd best leave Jinan City soon.

125
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,240
Who said I'm leaving Jinan City?

126
00:08:03,390 --> 00:08:05,480
You've been expelled
from the Shaman Clan

127
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,360
and accused of murder.

128
00:08:07,510 --> 00:08:08,750
If you don't leave Jinan City,

129
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,950
do you mean to stay and await your doom?

130
00:08:11,830 --> 00:08:12,680
Or is it that

131
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,800
you can't bear to leave your mother?

132
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:17,120
Xiuxiu.

133
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,950
My mother?

134
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:22,390
How do you know my mother?

135
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,040
The Shaman Clan
is under my jurisdiction.

136
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:28,270
Your relationship
with Grand Shaman Yaohua

137
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:29,390
may fool others,

138
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:31,600
but not me.

139
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:34,910
(Since he has such power,)

140
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,510
(perhaps I should let him)

141
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,360
(help me become Grand Shaman.)

142
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,750
If you spare me today,

143
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,550
I will clear your name

144
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,150
and help you leave Jinan City.

145
00:08:45,630 --> 00:08:46,550
I told you,

146
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:48,200
I don't want to leave Jinan City.

147
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:50,000
Not only that,

148
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:52,240
I will become the Grand Shaman.

149
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,000
Why do you want to become Grand Shaman?

150
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:55,840
Diviner Song,

151
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,200
is it so hard to understand?

152
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,910
Among the Shaman Clan's shamanesses,

153
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,790
who wouldn't want
to become Grand Shaman?

154
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,200
Rest assured,

155
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,480
once I become Grand Shaman,

156
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,670
I'll be your most obedient dog,
Diviner Song.

157
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,910
You want to be my dog?

158
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,510
Your lapdog.

159
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,910
(I'm your most obedient dog.)

160
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:20,240
You still say such outrageous things.

161
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:35,720
Seal it with a handclasp.

162
00:09:42,630 --> 00:09:43,600
Miss Chu Li,

163
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:46,480
you've been expelled
from the Shaman Clan

164
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,720
and have no merit.

165
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,510
I advise you to leave Jinan City soon.

166
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,480
(Love's)

167
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:55,270
(debt)

168
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,270
(is hard)

169
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,440
(to repay.)

170
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:09,630
My merit?

171
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:10,670
Here it comes.

172
00:10:15,190 --> 00:10:20,860
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

173
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:27,940
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

174
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:32,790
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

175
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:36,270
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

176
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:42,180
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

177
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:48,860
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

178
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:56,910
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

179
00:10:57,160 --> 00:11:00,670
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

180
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:04,009
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

181
00:11:04,051 --> 00:11:10,990
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

182
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:14,550
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

183
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:18,790
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

184
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:25,150
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

185
00:11:54,220 --> 00:12:01,009
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

186
00:12:01,051 --> 00:12:07,230
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
